WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Hi there. Firstly, thank you for booking
this call, and congratulations.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:08.380
So before we jump into this, it is my job to make
sure you do your research and your diligence.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:14.180
If you're anything like me and spend a ton of time on your
business, you'll know a lot of that time is wasted.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:18.920
And maybe that has led you to not trust
in individuals or agencies.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:22.840
So let me tell you a little bit about me,
the business and what you can expect.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:27.760
I've generated over 220 million rand for clients,

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:32.800
and I've done over 1000 of these calls
with business owners just like you.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.500
So I've compiled all the concerns and all the
questions in little 30 second snippets.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:42.780
So just scroll down below.
They are on 1.5 times speed,

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:48.360
so you can get through them real quick and have a
look at every single question and concern.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.380
I'm really excited to see you on the other side.
